This crate runs EmbeddingGemma 2 (google/embeddinggemma-2). It ships no model
weights: the weights are downloaded separately and are subject to Google's
Gemma terms of use (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms). The model architecture
follows the reference implementation in Hugging Face transformers
(Apache-2.0), which the parity tests compare against
(bench/gemma/reference.py).

The parity test images that bench/gemma/reference.py writes are scikit-image
sample data (public domain / CC0); they are generated, not stored in this
repository.
